  documentation for who is an author and how to add or correct your entry.
title: proTES
abstract: >-
  proTES is a gateway for the GA4GH Task Execution Service (TES) API that
  federates TES instances. Clients send their tasks to proTES as to any TES
  instance; proTES passes each task through a configurable pipeline of
  plugins, which pick the TES instance to run it on (e.g., in order, with
  failover, randomly, for load balancing, or the one closest to the task's
  input data) or change the request, forwards it there and tracks its state. It is built with FOCA and
  deployed with Docker Compose or its Helm chart.
